{
  "nl": "大区同步管理：查询有主体名称；表格展示主体名称、所选省份、所属大区；支持新增、编辑、删除。表单里「所属大区」自动等于所选省份，并且在所选省份非空时不可手改。",
  "nlEn": "Region-sync management: query by entity name; the table shows entity name, chosen province and region; supports add, edit and delete. In the form the \"region\" is set automatically to the chosen province and cannot be edited while a province is selected.",
  "fixedFields": [
    "entityName",
    "province",
    "region"
  ],
  "pinnedDims": [
    "propSet",
    "actions",
    "reactions:region"
  ],
  "config": {
    "name": "RegionSyncManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/region-syncs",
    "target": "vue3",
    "fields": [
      {
        "prop": "entityName",
        "label": "主体名称",
        "formtype": "Input"
      },
      {
        "prop": "province",
        "label": "所选省份",
        "formtype": "Select",
        "inQuery": false,
        "dataOptions": [
          {
            "label": "浙江",
            "value": "zj"
          },
          {
            "label": "江苏",
            "value": "js"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "prop": "region",
        "label": "所属大区",
        "formtype": "Input",
        "inQuery": false,
        "reactions": [
          {
            "dependencies": [
              "province"
            ],
            "fulfill": {
              "value": {
                "var": "province"
              },
              "disabled": {
                "notEmpty": [
                  {
                    "var": "province"
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "actions": [
      "add",
      "edit",
      "delete"
    ]
  },
  "notes": "AI-07: 同一条规则同时给出 value（回写）与 disabled（只读）—— 自动同步且不可手改（vue3/schema）。2026-10-29 修正 disabled 的算子：NL 说「在所选省份非空时不可手改」，原文写 truthy（对 0/false/'' 与 notEmpty 不等价），按 NL 改用 notEmpty"
}
